            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.7: Scroll is yours to steer. Tap ⌥W, scroll through the page or chat yourself, tap ⌥W again: one tall shot opens large. Only the part that moves is kept, so chats and logs inside a page come out clean.</p>
